---
import { projectPath } from '@/lib/project-paths';
---
<section id="method" class="f3-method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
  <div class="f3-section-heading"><h2 id="method-title">Built to run. Measured in 3D.</h2><a class="f3-text-link" href={projectPath('/frontier3dbench/evaluation/')}>Evaluation metrics ↗</a></div>
  <p class="f3-research-intro">Native projects connect visual quality to real geometry and executable behavior. Independent evaluation measures what agents build, how it looks, and how it works.</p>
  <div class="f3-method-flow" role="img" aria-label="Coding agents build native projects. Submitted assets are independently executed and scored for appearance, structure, and task fulfillment.">
    <div class="f3-method-step">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 170 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="20" y="13" width="130" height="76" rx="9"/><path d="M20 33h130"/><circle cx="31" cy="23" r="2"/><circle cx="39" cy="23" r="2"/><circle cx="47" cy="23" r="2"/><path class="strong" d="m67 47-15 13 15 13m36-26 15 13-15 13m-15-30-7 34"/></svg>
      <span>01</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Agents write and execute code.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="f3-method-step">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 170 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="32" y="14" width="88" height="68" rx="7"/><rect x="47" y="24" width="88" height="68" rx="7"/><path class="strong" d="m91 38 20 11v22L91 82 71 71V49zm-20 11 20 11 20-11M91 60v22"/></svg>
      <span>02</span><h3>Submit</h3><p>Editable Blender &amp; UE5 projects.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="f3-method-step">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 170 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30 30V16h22m66 0h22v14m0 42v14h-22M52 86H30V72"/><path class="strong" d="m85 27 28 16v31L85 90 57 74V43zm-28 16 28 16 28-16M85 59v31"/><path d="M18 51h24m86 0h24"/></svg>
      <span>03</span><h3>Execute</h3><p>Render, inspect, and interact.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="f3-method-step">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 170 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M27 14v74h120"/><rect class="bar" x="45" y="52" width="20" height="35" rx="3"/><rect class="bar" x="81" y="34" width="20" height="53" rx="3"/><rect class="bar" x="117" y="17" width="20" height="70" rx="3"/></svg>
      <span>04</span><h3>Score</h3><p>Task-specific criteria. One scale.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="f3-evidence-strip"><span>Visual fidelity</span><span>Structural consistency</span><span>Task fulfillment</span></div>
</section>
